Fixed the Job detail page not loading the code of a JOBS_ROOT or Git repository Job when the web worker serving the request had not yet imported it.
Fixed a 500 error on the Job detail page for a Job with an overridden time limit when the Job's code could not be loaded. The default time limit is now shown as unknown.
Fixed the Job detail page repeating "default is" for overridden fields on a Job that is not installed.
